      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:i8vd87'
    '|b||And over effort they found considerably more. Work gets pushed later; money, much less.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6280
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1x8sleb'
    '|a||So present bias over effort and treats: mostly agreed. How strong it is, and whether it reaches money: contested.':
